1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,400
[OMINOUS MUSIC PLAYING]

2
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:06,767
I already arranged everything.

3
00:00:06,767 --> 00:00:08,433
Security will be on their way
too

4
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:10,200
so don't worry anymore.

5
00:00:10,567 --> 00:00:12,267
[PING] I'll make
sure you're safe.

6
00:00:14,667 --> 00:00:16,033
What are you doing here?!

7
00:00:16,033 --> 00:00:17,367
- [SLAP LANDS]
- [ZIA GRUNTS]

8
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,067
You should be asking her
why she's here in the mansion!

9
00:00:23,533 --> 00:00:25,300
You're really shameless,
aren't you?

10
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:26,433
- [SLAP LANDS]
- [ZIA GRUNTS]

11
00:00:26,433 --> 00:00:28,633
What if I dropped a flower pot
on you instead, huh?

12
00:00:29,033 --> 00:00:30,733
You two-faced fraud!

13
00:00:30,733 --> 00:00:33,067
You're the fraud!

14
00:00:33,067 --> 00:00:34,100
Scammer!

15
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:36,000
[PING] What are you talking
about?

16
00:00:38,767 --> 00:00:42,367
Presenting her Uncle Dennis!

17
00:00:42,367 --> 00:00:46,033
[FOOTSTEPS APPROACHING]

18
00:00:46,033 --> 00:00:48,367
Uncle Dennis,
what are you doing here?

19
00:00:49,133 --> 00:00:51,333
Now's not really the time
for you to be borrowing money...

20
00:00:51,333 --> 00:00:54,367
I came here to tell the truth.

21
00:00:54,367 --> 00:00:57,400
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

22
00:00:57,400 --> 00:00:59,367
You're adopted, June!

23
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:07,000
That's not true!

24
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:09,067
How much did you pay him?

25
00:01:09,067 --> 00:01:10,500
Just because we didn't lend you
money,

26
00:01:10,700 --> 00:01:12,600
you're already turning
to this fraud of a lawyer!

27
00:01:13,333 --> 00:01:15,267
[PING] And all of the records
and credible witnesses

28
00:01:15,267 --> 00:01:17,267
point that June
is indeed a Rose.

29
00:01:17,467 --> 00:01:20,167
You're still defending
this scammer?!

30
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:23,600
This peasant is just pretending
as a Rose

31
00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:26,033
to get Don Nato's money!

32
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:28,767
[DENNIS] She is her mother's
daughter

33
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:31,533
but she is not
her father's!

34
00:01:31,733 --> 00:01:34,633
That's why she is not a Rose!

35
00:01:34,633 --> 00:01:41,600
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

36
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:44,467
Ima?

37
00:01:45,333 --> 00:01:46,567
Is is true?

38
00:01:47,833 --> 00:01:49,733
Am I adopted?

39
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:53,833
Ima!

40
00:01:53,833 --> 00:01:54,867
[THUDS]

41
00:01:54,867 --> 00:02:01,833
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]
